Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:58.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《勇敢者的游戏：宇宙历险》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:02:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啦 就这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,接得漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice grab.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 丹尼 轮到你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Danny, your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么快？我的回合还没有结束呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I didn't get my full turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.25,0:03:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 我数过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did. I counted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.49,0:03:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,25个回合 我们之间说好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was 25. That's what we said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不公平 - 这恰恰就是公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not fair. - It's exactly fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 丹尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到你了 这轮结束后我得去工作一个小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for your turn, then I gotta work for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 爹地可不是只陪你一个人玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're not the only one who gets a turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,「只陪一个人玩」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The only one who gets a turn."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.93,0:03:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得全神贯注盯着球的来路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eye on the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把握好接的时机 准备好了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it this time. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 接得挺好！只是我扔的太烂了 我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's a good try. It was a bad throw. It's a bad throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起咯我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 再来一次 这次你能接到的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Here we go. You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要传球了 准备好了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,球高高飞向右边场地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A deep fly ball to the right field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱门特补位策应 飞速回追接球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clemente back, running on his horse real fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.23,0:03:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能接到球吗？他能做到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can he get it? Can he get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.27,0:04:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 米尔顿·布拉德利做了个鱼跃翻身式的拦截{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and Milton Bradley with his dive-and-roll catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「闪躲者」队胜利了 - 你真是个恶棍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dodgers win. - You're such a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.74,0:04:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有什么关系？这个拦截不精彩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It was a great grab.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 你不该用那样的词来形容你哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, you should not be using that kind of language with your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.77,0:04:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他就是那么坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.27,0:04:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 宝贝 当我六岁大的时候…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, kiddo, when I was 6 years old…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,六岁 九个月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six and three quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.45,0:04:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我在六岁九个月大的时候…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was 6 and three quarters…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,接球对我来说是件很困难的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}catching was hard for me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 对沃尔特来说 那可轻松了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not hard for Walter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.78,0:04:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可沃尔特现在已经10岁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Walter's 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何 反正他做什么都比我强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? He's still better than me at everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里 他钢琴就没你弹得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. He's not better than you at piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.16,0:04:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我又不喜欢钢琴…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate that stupid thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 你甚至会感谢我送给了你那架钢琴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someday you're gonna be really happy I got you that piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会有机会在聚会上演奏 而有个美丽的女孩也为你所吸引…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be at a party, there'll be a pretty girl…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你和妈妈的故事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you and Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 丹尼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Danny…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.28,0:05:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和沃尔特可不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and Walter are different people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.15,0:05:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人各有自己拿手好戏 他有他的强项{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's good at some things, you're good at other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也有你的擅长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how people are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做什么都赢我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He beats me at everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 了解这点很重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个很特别的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a very special kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们想不出办法来解释事实时 总用这样的话来推脱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what people say when they can't think of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得你总是自己编个游戏…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how you always make up games…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,并扮演其中的角色吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pretend to be characters?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.67,0:05:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那恰恰说明你拥有 与众不同的想象力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have an incredible imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议的想象力 丰富而不凡！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing imagination. A whole universe of an imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是靠想象力工作的人 所以我的评价就特别有价值{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I use my imagination for a living, so I know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的想象力比沃尔特好吗？- 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it better than Walter's? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的想象力比沃尔特好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my imagination better than Walter's?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比沃尔特更与众不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're different than Walter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别做这么危险的举动 - 玩儿传接球吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do that. - You wanna play catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是刚玩过吗？- 不 用橄榄球来玩儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We just played catch. - No, football catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.27,0:06:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 我得工作上一小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to work for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可今天是周六！- 那又怎么样呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it's Saturday. - Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你总是说要工作 - 说得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All you ever do is work. - Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 偏心！- 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is so unfair. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔 我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.82,0:06:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我两分钟内就给你回电 如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you back in two minutes. Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.66,0:06:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.09,0:06:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午我得参加一个相当重要的会议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an important meeting this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得… 好好做些准备 - 你要出门吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've… I really have to be ready for it. - You're going out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我得出门去 有一个会议需要出席{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm going out. Well, I'm going to a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正 你们就要到妈妈家去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be at Mom's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在3点左右就会来接你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's coming to get you at 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是明天才去妈妈那儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go to Mom's house tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 是今天 - 这周你得照看我们4天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, today. - This is a four-day Dad week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.11,0:06:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,「3天爹地」周 上周「4天妈咪」周…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three-day Dad week. Four-day last week…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周我得带你们4天 而这周我带你们3天就够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}four-day next week, three-day this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.91,0:06:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这周就是「4天妈咪周」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four-day Mom week this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.71,0:07:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不公平啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对谁不公平？- 对每个人都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To whom? - To anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得工作！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没丹尼捣乱的话 我们本就能好好享受这几天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd have all the time if Danny wasn't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 丹尼确实无处不在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Danny is around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就陪我最后扔5个！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, five throws.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.19,0:07:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢 我想想 我得工作！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I put this? Let me think. I have to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,爹地 现在可以陪我玩「毁灭兄弟」了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I'm ready to play "Smash Bros."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应和他玩「毁灭兄弟」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told him you'd play "Smash Bros"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有！我没答应陪他玩什么「毁灭兄弟」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't tell him I was gonna play "Smash Bros."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.97,0:07:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要和沃尔特玩传接球？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're playing catch with Walter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没一直烦我们 他当然会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might if you weren't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.11,0:07:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我太坏了 每个人都不想我过得开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so mean. Everybody wants to ruin my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总不遵守诺言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never keep your promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的父亲只有一个 好不好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one of me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不喜欢这样的情形 你们总是这样争吵…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like this situation either, it sucks, is what it does…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是我所能做的最大的努力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is the best I could come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.19,0:07:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可否离我远点儿 给我点留自己的空间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So climb off my back and give me about two inches of space, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还会一起经历很多 孩子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are some days, boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.01,0:08:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们成长的路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you gotta grow up all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望经过今天发生的事你们 学得再懂事点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need today to be one of those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩儿飞行棋吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna play Chutes and Ladders?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你会耍赖的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you'll cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩脑力挑战赛怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stratego?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.53,0:08:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你玩棋盘游戏总是作弊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you cheat at board games.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.43,0:08:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可在脑力挑战赛中没法作弊嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't even cheat at Stratego.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来这套 反正你总是有办法耍赖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, you'll find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.87,0:08:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.41,0:08:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 不 不没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想3：30准能完成 那时我去见他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not meeting him till 3:30, I can finish by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特 看看我找到了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter, look what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的东西 把它们放回原位去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those belong to me. Put them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我从没见你玩过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you never play with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何 它们还是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? They're still mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不记得你从何时开始 对我这么不客气了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you get so mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没故意针对你 丹尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not mean, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.36,0:08:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道 我四年级了 已经有女朋友了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in fourth grade, I have a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得爹地说的：我们得学着快点长大 别再那么幼稚？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how Dad said we have to grow up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 我们得照他说的做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们玩「军官」游戏好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we please play "Army Men"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,中士 有一架直升机起火了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant, there is a helicopter on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去处理一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,制图和实体模型大小完全吻合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drawings all match the foam mockup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还给我！- 就让我拿着嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get back here. - Let me hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 是红色 - 给我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, red. - Give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,酸果蔓红 对 就是他们选的那颜色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cranberry, right. It's whatever color they picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初我有记下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked from the chits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能过会再给您挂过去吗？家里有点事得处理一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I call you back one more time? It's a small domestic emergency here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 我… 知道 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I… I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爹地 - 没问题 好的 谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad. - It's not a problem. Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看他做的好事 - 我刚才可是在接电话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look what he did. - I was on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这只是个意外 - 你就是这么不懂事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was an accident. - You're such a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是！- 你要弄坏我所有的东西才高兴？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not a baby. - You break all my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.73,0:09:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你连个球都接不住… - 够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't catch a ball… - That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人喜欢你在旁边烦！- 你给我闭嘴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and nobody wants you around. - You shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了 对不起 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.01,0:09:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去办公室一下 10分钟就回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 10 minutes to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.22,0:09:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得再赶份新的草图出来 等我回来喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to run off another copy. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.39,0:09:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就让我俩自个儿 呆在这间毛骨悚然的屋子里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna leave us alone in this creepy old house?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这没什么好害怕的 就是旧了点 - 妈妈才不会这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not creepy, it's old. - I like Mom's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 没错反正现在也轮她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so did she, and now it's hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这是间十分不一般的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this is a very special house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我努力工作来整修它的原因是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reason I'm working to fix it up is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让这儿成为我们温暖的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna make a home for us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.57,0:10:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这里不像妈妈的屋子那么好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know it's not Mom's house,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而确实这房子已经有些破旧了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know it's a little creaky…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.78,0:10:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 给它点时间 它会让你们有家的感觉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but give it some time, it's gonna grow on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 我可不想孤零零地呆这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't wanna stay here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 你们不会觉得孤单的 我去叫醒丽莎来陪你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're not gonna be alone. I'm going to wake up Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 别叫醒丽莎！- 什么？你疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, don't wake up Lisa. - What, are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还在睡觉呢 就让她睡吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's sleeping. Let her sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.19,0:10:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.49,0:10:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽莎 甜心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa. Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得出去一下 你得帮忙照顾一下你最喜爱的那俩个小家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to go out. I need you to look after your two favorite people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行嘛 我晚上有约会呢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I have a date tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,几点的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好象是约八点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hooking up at, like, 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在才两点 - 那又怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's 2. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.91,0:10:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,离你的约会还有六个小时呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's six hours from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么样嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你好好照看那俩活宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to look after the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:11:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 这让我很不舒服的是你用「上钩」来形容你的约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, it makes me uncomfortable when you say "hooking up."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,又怎么了？那又不意味着会发生什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? It's not like it means anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.42,0:11:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希望不会 - 不会啦 只是种说法罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hope it doesn't. - It doesn't. It's just an expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希望如此 - 当然啦！天那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hope it is. - It is. God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.06,Title,0,0,0,0,,我们真不该租《芳龄十三》来看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never should have rented Thirteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯着点他们 别让他们把房子拆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eye on them. Make sure they don't burn down the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.87,0:11:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听到了么？- 我又没聋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - I'm not deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.27,0:11:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我又没聋 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not deaf. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爹地！好了 我知道了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五分钟之内我就起来 行行好把门关上吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen minutes, just close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.69,0:11:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,对是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的先等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,爹地说过不让玩电视游戏！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad said no video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.14,0:12:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是长颈鹿宝宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a giraffe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在是「体育中心」栏目时间 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is SportsCenter. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也看过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was watching that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.81,0:12:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是奥克兰 是波士顿 那是曼尼·拉米雷兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Oakland. It is Boston. It is Manny Ramirez.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.35,0:12:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不看超级海绵历险记吗？- 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't we watch SpongeBob? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你以前不是喜欢吗？- 过去是过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You used to like it. - Times change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗒嗒沙拉酱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tartar sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.29,0:12:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you want me to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我做奶酪通心面吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make me macaroni and cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.46,0:12:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.87,0:12:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿 那你会做什么咯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry. What do you know how to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.03,0:12:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分全垒打！不可思议！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two-run shot. Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:13:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个击球手 詹森 瓦里台克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next batter, Jason Varitek.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.91,0:13:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,球被击到空中 径直飞向右场尽头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the air to deep right field. Down the line, towards the pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们玩传接球好不？- 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How about if you and me play catch? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.49,0:13:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个全垒打跑垒的人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first guy to give up walk-off home runs…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,自1998年至今{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on consecutive days since 1998.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.89,0:13:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士顿以6：5胜出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bo Sox win it 6 to 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史将会记得这一刻…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}History-making moment for…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.59,0:13:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:13:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.97,0:14:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿 丹尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you, Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到你了 - 我说了对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There you are. - I said I was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 这不好玩 - 在爹地回来前 你就呆这儿吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do that, it's not funny. - You'll be safe here till Dad gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为爹地觉得我比你聪明 所以你嫉妒了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just jealous because Dad thinks I'm smarter than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随便说说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特 不 拉我上来 别！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter. No. Pull me up. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有什么关系 丹尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看这么大了 应该不怕地下室了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not still scared of the basement, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特！不 沃尔特！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter! No, Walter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好玩儿 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not funny! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉我上去！沃尔特！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull me up! Walter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.99,0:15:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,3岁小孩才怕地下室！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three-year-olds are scared of basements.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太坏了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.40,0:17:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,爹地说了别在那儿玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad said not to play in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我在地下室找到了什么！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what I found in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊的老游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks dumb and old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然你会喜欢 这就是为小孩子准备的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you would, it's for babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特 这游戏棒极了 过来看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter, this is so cool. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.54,0:17:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是Zathura？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Zathura?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和我一起玩吗？- 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you play with me? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会耍赖皮的 - 喔 你会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I won't cheat. - Yeah, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跳出了张卡片！- 不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A card came out. - Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.41,0:19:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我读一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,「流星雨降临 请回避」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Meteor shower. Take evasive action."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.31,0:19:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫快回避？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's evasive action?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是让你躲着点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's when you get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要躲着点什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly am I supposed to get out of the way of, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.32,0:19:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 它就写着：「请回…」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea. All it says is "Take evasive a…"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.12,0:19:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,流星雨！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's meteors!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:20:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快躲好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take erasive action!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.56,0:20:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快闪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take erasive action!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.99,0:20:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 躲这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 快 这里安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, hurry up. It's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 来啊 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, come on. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.43,0:20:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 来啊 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, come on, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 来 进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, hurry, hurry. Come on. Get in, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是「体育中心」栏目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is SportsCenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.05,0:20:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢林将不再与续约…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schilling deals no love…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们不该把那游戏再玩下去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we should play that game anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.63,0:21:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.77,0:21:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有客厅被袭击了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only hit the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 太空！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, outer space.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.79,0:22:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 大概只是晚上到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's just nighttime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.32,0:22:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我总觉得从没看得这么清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Walter. Night never looked so close before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.91,0:22:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特 快来看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.83,0:24:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快告诉她 - 你说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell her. - You tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.80,0:24:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的话 她或许不会气得发疯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should, she won't freak out as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.70,0:24:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们或许不该到她房里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't really even be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.71,0:24:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 我们呆在太空！现在你还管那么多？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, we're in outer space. It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.97,0:24:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你叫醒她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you wake her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.71,0:24:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫就我叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.65,0:24:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.61,0:24:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽莎 丽莎…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa. Lisa…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.68,0:24:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离我远点儿 - 丽莎你得起来看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go away. - Lisa, you gotta get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.45,0:24:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得进我房间 你们得守什么规矩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the rule about being in my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.32,0:24:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非有紧急情况 否则 我们不能擅自进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not allowed in unless it's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.99,0:24:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 有什么紧急情况？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's the emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.53,0:24:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚下了场流星雨 好多东西都被砸坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a meteor shower and everything got wrecked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.36,0:24:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们回不了地球了 - 够了 闭嘴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't get back to Earth. - Okay, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.53,0:24:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看 - 就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just look. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.54,0:24:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 不 - 我们该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. - What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.57,0:24:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,天已经黑了？我要迟到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's already dark? I'm gonna be so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.54,0:24:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是天黑了！- 我们是被困在太空里了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not dark. - We're in outer space.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.47,0:24:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都看见土星了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw Saturn outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.45,0:24:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽莎 开门啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa, open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.41,0:24:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你们的嘴 听着！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up and listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.68,0:24:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,爹地让我在他回家前好好看着你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad put me in charge until he got home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.82,0:24:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着 你们得事事都听我的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means you guys need to do what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.85,0:24:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙吧 都给我下楼呆着 别让我看到你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor. Go downstairs and stay out of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.66,0:24:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 这是紧急情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.09,0:24:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 房子有着火吗？- 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is the house on fire? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.89,0:25:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人伤着了？- 也没有 不过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is anyone hurt? - No, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.59,0:25:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就快离我远点儿 - 丽莎 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then leave. - Lisa, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.50,0:25:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的很害怕 你能帮我们看看这是什么鬼玩意儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're really scared. Can you just watch what this game does?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.40,0:25:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是你们捉弄人的无聊把戏 你们俩就死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is some weird joke you guys are trying to pull, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.84,0:25:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不是什么把戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.31,0:25:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿 看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, watch this. Watch this. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.74,0:25:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 先拧钥匙 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. So wind the key. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.35,0:25:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么我现在开始拧钥匙 - 好 你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So now I'm winding the key. - Yeah, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后按这个键 - 就这样按？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And then push the button. - So I push it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.88,0:25:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 按这个键{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Pushing the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.32,0:25:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着数字就开始变化 停下时会显示个数字 比如说9{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the number winds, and whatever the number is, like nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.36,0:25:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你的飞船… 蓝色的那艘…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then your ship… The blue ship…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.22,0:25:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色的是我的 我转到了五{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because the red ship is mine, and I got a five.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.59,0:25:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后它就走到第九格 就要发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then it goes to nine, which would be that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.36,0:25:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 然后就会有张卡片跑出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Then the card's gonna pop out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.47,0:25:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡片 - 卡片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The card. - The card.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.73,0:25:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出来了！- 卡片！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The card! - The card!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.97,0:25:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是这卡 - 可怕的事要发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The card. - Here's the scary part.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.54,0:25:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,「您被提升为船长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You're promoted to a starship captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.44,0:25:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为奖励 可向前移动两步「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move ahead two spaces."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.31,0:25:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.71,0:25:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丽莎 不 不！丽莎！- 不 等等 丽莎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lisa, no, no! Lisa! - No, wait, Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.01,0:25:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那不算 该我走了 轮我了 好 看着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, that one didn't count. Let me go. Let me go. Here. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.12,0:26:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡住了？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.56,0:26:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们该轮流来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we have to take turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.06,0:26:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了？该我了呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? It was my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.40,0:26:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 四！- 也 四步！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Four. - Yeah, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.60,0:26:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.83,0:26:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员进入冷冻睡眠室5回合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shipmate enters cryonic sleep chamber for 5 turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.98,0:26:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the heck does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.59,0:26:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽莎？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.29,0:26:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,「冷冻」是冰冻的意思吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does "cryonic" mean ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.26,0:26:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.93,0:26:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.36,0:27:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我杀了她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.20,0:27:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有害她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.77,0:27:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是被冻住了 有点像冬眠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's frozen in cryonic sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.37,0:27:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得帮她把外层的冰给化了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta melt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.46,0:27:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.59,0:27:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能就让她保持这样的状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just leave her here like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.56,0:27:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许读读游戏说明对我们会有帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should read the instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.23,0:27:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Zathura注意了 太空冒险者们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Zathura. Attention, space adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.04,0:27:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Zathura等待着你们的到来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zathura awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.87,0:28:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,航行中会遇到的无法预料的危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have what it takes to navigate the galaxy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.34,0:28:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,此游戏不适合心脏脆弱者加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not for the faint of heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.41,0:28:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦开始了冒险…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once you embark upon your journey…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.31,0:28:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非到达Zathura 否则就回不了头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no turning back until Zathura's reached.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.78,0:28:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在游戏结束后一切才会恢复正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pieces reset at the end of each game.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.88,0:28:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,适合各年龄层的各种冒险者 百玩不厌「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play again and again for different adventures."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.59,0:28:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些 看来我们得继续玩下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. We gotta keep playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.36,0:28:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再碰那玩意儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not playing that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.39,0:28:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们得继续！上面说只有我们胜利了 才能回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we are. It says we go home if we win.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.03,0:28:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这… 上面没这样写着啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It… It didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.03,0:28:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,写着呢 「在游戏结束后一切才会恢复正常 」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it did."Pieces reset at the end of each game."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.96,0:28:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那意味着 游戏一结束 我们就能回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means we go home when we're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.97,0:28:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 玩这游戏 没发生过什么好事儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that when we play this game, bad things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而对我来说 每按一次键 我就能多走几步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that when I played, I got promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.37,0:28:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快走到终点 我们就能回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna win this and get us home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.31,0:28:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 我们能停下… - 别耍孩子气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, can we stop… - Don't be a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.24,0:28:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是个孩子了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.15,0:28:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 8步了 已经走到地图的一半了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, eight, I'm halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.67,0:29:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的机器人有缺陷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your robor is defectived.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.67,0:29:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.34,0:29:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,它说我的机器人出故障了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means my robot's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.91,0:29:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你压根儿就没机器人啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't even have a robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.07,0:29:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.07,0:29:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.58,0:29:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你的机器人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.32,0:29:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少我有个！- 喔 它能做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At least I got one. - Well, what does it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.85,0:29:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何我想要它做的事！给我弄盒果汁来 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything I want. Get me a juice box, beyotch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.49,0:29:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别那么做！- 你管得着么？那是我的机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do that. - Why not? It's my robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.83,0:29:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会让他发狂的 - 它不就3英尺高嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You might make it mad. - It's 3 inches tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.96,0:30:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能把它一脚踢出房间 那是我的机器人 卡片都写着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll punt it across the room. My robot, the card says.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.53,0:30:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又没说那不是你的机器人 你别这么神经质好不好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never said it wasn't your robot. You don't have to be such a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.77,0:30:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你根本就是嫉妒我有个机器人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you're just jealous I have a robot and you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.37,0:30:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你凭什么说我… - 紧急情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why would I want… - Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.47,0:30:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.65,0:30:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现外来生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alien life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.62,0:30:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须消灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.66,0:30:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特 我想它是在说你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter, I think he's talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.72,0:31:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现外来生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alien life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.72,0:31:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须消灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.69,0:31:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 快继续你的回合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, take your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.03,0:31:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 钥匙不见了 - 快找啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no key. - Find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.50,0:32:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 速度！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it, take it. Come on, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.72,0:32:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快继续啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.28,0:33:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才为什么不走？我差点被弄死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you go? I could have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.38,0:33:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕极了 不过还好 反正它现在走没影了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scared. But it's okay, he's gone, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.79,0:33:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 快继续你的回合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, take your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.77,0:34:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹尼 把卡给我 - 飞船还在走呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Danny, give me the card. - It's still moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.78,0:34:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 丹尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.42,0:34:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡出来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The card.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.74,0:34:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡上写着什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did the card say?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.60,0:35:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太靠近tsouris-3 进入重力场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pass too close to tsouris-3. Enter gravity field.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.45,0:35:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.28,0:35:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.28,0:35:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.07,0:36:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.77,0:36:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么？- 是丽莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - It's Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.45,0:37:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.46,0:37:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特 你觉得呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter, do you think she's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.27,0:37:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的 她还是老样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess. She's still in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.17,0:37:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.16,0:37:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.82,0:37:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那家伙已经玩完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.23,0:37:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.99,0:38:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那扇门能关得住它吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think the door will hold the robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.42,0:38:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.79,0:38:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.59,0:38:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 一旦它自我修复完毕 我们就得被它修理了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, once he fixes himself, we're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.03,0:38:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能自我修复？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fixing himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.80,0:39:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.05,0:39:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.85,0:39:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.75,0:39:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想她醒来时 在这被她逮个正着了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna be here when she wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.75,0:39:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.89,0:39:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续我的回合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.63,0:39:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？我们已经弄得一团糟了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy? That thing's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.80,0:39:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「您被提升为舰队司令 请向前移动四步 」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You're promoted to fleet admiral. Move ahead four spaces."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.18,0:39:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 轮到你了 - 我才不玩呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, your turn. - I'm not playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.89,0:39:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么？- 奶酪通心粉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Making mac and cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.19,0:40:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿没水 呆瓜 我们现在呆太空里呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no water, dummy, we're in outer space.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.33,0:40:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.07,0:40:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿了 而我知道你也不愿意照顾我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm hungry and I know you're not gonna take care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.47,0:40:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别费心了 根本就没煤气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother, the gas won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.88,0:40:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有啥好建议吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any more advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.78,0:40:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得开大点儿火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta turn it up more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.58,0:40:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我谈好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we at least talk about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.42,0:40:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好谈的 反正我不会继续玩下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to talk about, I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.56,0:40:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 我只想回地球 可没有你 我没法继续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, I just wanna go home, and I can't unless you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.00,0:40:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想回去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you wanna get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.03,0:40:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家有什么好的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so great about home, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.83,0:40:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思？每件事本来都很完美 直到你出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? Everything was great until you came along.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.80,0:40:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看？瞧瞧你对我的态度 像是所有的事都是我造成的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? You treat me like everything's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.21,0:40:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你先开始了这个游戏！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who pushed the button in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.04,0:40:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想和你一起玩游戏 沃尔特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to play a game with you, Walter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.15,0:40:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你想怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.92,0:40:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你不再对我那么刻薄 不再对我不理不睬…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you not to be mean to me, not ignore me…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.19,0:41:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我希望你能像亲兄弟一样地对待我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want you to treat me like your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.49,0:41:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 那我们就原谅彼此了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. - Do we have an understanding?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.56,0:41:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.26,0:41:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是容易吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.71,0:41:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,六{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.40,0:41:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,涡刚人来访{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are visited by Zogrons.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.09,0:41:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是涡刚人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a Zorgon?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.23,0:41:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看应该不是什么坏事 或许只是些造访者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's bad. Just visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.12,0:42:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,涡刚人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zorgons!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.01,0:42:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他们挺友好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.95,0:42:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来不像！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not friendly!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.89,0:43:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 壁炉快躲到壁炉里去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fireplace. Hide in the fireplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.38,0:43:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快闪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.33,0:43:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉过你我不想走的 都怪你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you I didn't wanna go. You're the one who made me spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.33,0:43:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们没有其他选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing else we could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.08,0:43:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还玩？- 有更好的主意吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you crazy? - Got any better ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.66,0:44:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,「程序重组」？这什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Reprogram"? What the heck does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.53,0:44:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问我我问谁？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.23,0:44:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,程序重组！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reprogram!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.72,0:44:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.92,0:44:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定过会就能用上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure it out later.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.13,0:44:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.73,0:44:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 继续啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.70,0:44:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！- 给我继续！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.56,0:45:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,「在直立的阿斯特罗草皮上休息 」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Rest on standing AstroTurf."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.50,0:45:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 在直立的阿斯特罗草皮上休息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Rest on standing AstroTurf.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.37,0:45:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我看看 - 不 我念得没错儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me read it. - No, I know how to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.37,0:45:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我念得没错儿 - 给我看看 上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know how to read. - Let me read it. God.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.83,0:45:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救落难宇航员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rescue Stranded astronaut.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.07,0:45:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,落难的宇航员？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What stranded astronaut?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.11,0:45:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想或许有什么宇航员遇到点麻烦或者…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess there's gonna be some stranded astronaut or some…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.61,0:46:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你锁门了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you lock the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.68,0:46:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.63,0:46:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩谁把我骗来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you spun me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.40,0:47:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪位？- 他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who was it? - Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.34,0:47:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么快就把你兄弟出卖了 小东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so quick to sell out your brother, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.71,0:47:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是你唯一的同伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.88,0:47:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们被涡刚人欺负得够呛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you got a pretty serious Zorgon problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.05,0:47:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.95,0:47:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 藏起来 - 藏着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hide. - Hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.79,0:47:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可它们会把整间房子给毁了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll just explode the whole house.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.52,0:47:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把房子藏起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna hide the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.50,0:47:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断所有电气用品的电源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn off all the lights and electrical appliances.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.10,0:47:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我？- 对 就是你 快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? - Yes, you. Go. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.31,0:47:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.31,0:47:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 过来 把炉子上的火关了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. Come on, kill that flame on the stove.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.48,0:47:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.89,0:48:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧瓦斯那很可能是 它们被引来的最直接原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burning gas. That's probably what brought them in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.30,0:48:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 现在去把高炉的标灯给灭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Now get the pilot light on the furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.60,0:48:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是标灯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a pilot light?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.57,0:48:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地下室 加热器下还燃烧着的那微弱火苗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the basement. Little blue flame under the big heater.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.38,0:48:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,像吹灭蜡烛一样 这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blow it out like a candle. Like this:
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.37,0:49:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙要把爹地的沙发给毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter, the astronaut guy is wrecking Dad's couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.65,0:49:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.65,0:49:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是爹地休息的沙发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Dad's nap couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.90,0:49:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不过来帮帮我把它弄出去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna help me get this out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.22,0:50:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击它吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.19,0:50:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击它吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.83,0:50:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.60,0:50:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现它啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.97,0:50:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟它去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.90,0:50:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟它去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.71,0:50:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.07,0:50:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.25,0:50:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,涡刚人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zorgons.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.39,0:50:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种巨大而丑陋的蜥蜴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're big, gnarly lizards.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.69,0:50:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是冷血的肉食者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold-blooded heatseekers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.59,0:50:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是一点火星的温度 都会把它们成群地引来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the tiniest spark of warmth will bring them in like moths.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.36,0:50:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在星际中漂浮…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flying all around the galaxy…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.03,0:50:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜寻能拿来生火的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for anything they could find to burn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.67,0:50:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么不在自己的星球上找燃料？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't they just burn up their own planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.84,0:50:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 他们确实有这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.67,0:50:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这还不是最糟糕的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not even the worst of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.91,0:51:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,最令人害怕的 在于它们那填不满的贪婪欲望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real problem is their ravenous appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.04,0:51:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们总是在找吃的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never stop eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.91,0:51:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们吃什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.58,0:51:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肉 - 真有品位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meat. - That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.82,0:51:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你就是肉做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you're meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.12,0:51:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是为了让涡刚人不再找上门来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you doing this to keep Zorgons away?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.19,0:51:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.49,0:51:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,15年来我已经吃够了液体食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing this because I've been eating paste out of a tube for 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.35,0:52:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真衰 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This totally sucks. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.35,0:52:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要把我们的食物给吃光了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's eating all our food.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.18,0:52:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何？卢皮已经去买东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? Lupe just went shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.45,0:52:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们还要在这里呆多久吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you think we're gonna be out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.62,0:52:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能还得几个星期 那么你想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be weeks. Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.46,0:52:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.29,0:52:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这里的氧气？他呆这儿把氧气给吸个精光了 我们怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about air? How long is it gonna last before he breathes it all up?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.56,0:52:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想 - 我得和他谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I guess. - I'm gonna say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.30,0:52:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 等等 沃尔特 沃尔特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. Walter. Walter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.21,0:52:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 这可是我们的食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, that's our food.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.94,0:52:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我看你们得勒紧裤腰带了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. And you're running low on supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.01,0:52:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我知道 几乎都到你肚子里去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. You're eating it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.12,0:52:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 可我好象记得卡片上写着：「救援落难的宇航员」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as I recall, the card said, "Rescue stranded astronaut."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.29,0:52:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我也确实帮了你俩大忙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks to me like I'm the only one that's doing any rescuing…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.22,0:53:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我可不认为 就吃你们几块三明治有多过分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I don't think a couple Dagwood sandwiches is too much to ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.36,0:53:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿鬼 东西都要被你吃光了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dog, you're eating it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.40,0:53:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我穿过一个时间隧道才到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I passed through a time sphincter to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.50,0:53:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道那有多费力吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize how difficult that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.57,0:53:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不就是时间隧道么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a time sphincter?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.21,0:53:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 可不像你们想的 那像一个虫洞 就这么大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wormhole, about yay big:
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.84,0:53:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去那儿挤挤试试…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You squeeze through there…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.24,0:53:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没饿得能吞下条鲨鱼 我就不信你能钻过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me you're not hungry enough to eat a carpet shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.95,0:53:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你似乎还有挺多路要赶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like you got a long trip ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.68,0:53:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔你赶我走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you telling me to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.45,0:53:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 嗯至少你可以等吃完了再{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, once you get finished eating, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.19,0:53:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 我不想让你失望 但我走不走不是你说了算的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hate to break it to you, but that's not your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.03,0:53:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我找来的 所以得由他决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spun me, so it's up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.10,0:53:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 我可是舰队司令 我命令你立刻离开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm fleet admiral, and I'm telling you to hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.91,0:53:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 抱歉 长官 我不… 不知道您是舰队司令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize, sir. I didn't… I didn't realize you were a fleet admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.18,0:53:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.88,0:53:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是舰队司令！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fleet admiral too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.69,0:54:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为卡片说什么就是什么？傻瓜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a card, bug nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.79,0:54:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 他也想让你走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he wants you to leave too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.16,0:54:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 丹尼？你想让我离开？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That true, Danny? You want me to split?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.19,0:54:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然了 - 嘿 传声筒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course he does. - Hey, mouthpiece…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.13,0:54:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他回答 行吗？我必须要从大家伙那里听到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}let him answer, all right? I need to hear it from the big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.50,0:54:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.50,0:54:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 告诉他你希望他走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, tell him you want him to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.44,0:54:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他确实帮了我们些忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he did help out a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.67,0:54:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮忙？他烧了我们的沙发 现在又吃了我们所有的食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help? He burned our couch and now he's eating all our food.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.81,0:54:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也叫帮忙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call that helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.21,0:54:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.65,0:54:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是离开这算了 我觉得自己是多余的累赘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna go. I feel like a third wheel anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.95,0:54:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩这么团结{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you guys are such a tight, unified team here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.45,0:54:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥困难都难不倒 顺便说一句 这房子可真不赖！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing great too. I gotta tell you, the house looks fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.99,0:54:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我就闪了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll just get out of your hair…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.76,0:54:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,涡刚人再来找麻烦 可别想起我喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let you guys whomp some more Zorgon butt without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.77,0:54:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.73,0:54:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是他的 还是我的弟弟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose brother are you, his or mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.42,0:55:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.29,0:55:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然是命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orders are orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.79,0:55:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续游戏吧 司令 该你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, admiral, your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.26,0:55:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.67,0:55:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他能帮上忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.51,0:55:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你俩怎么还不开始？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Why haven't you guys started yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.14,0:55:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.55,0:55:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我在这了 顺时针方向旋转钥匙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, I'm here, so turn that clockwise…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.72,0:55:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得了吧 我知道怎么玩儿 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I know how to play the game. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.69,0:55:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 有点儿不对劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on a second. Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.42,0:55:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.03,0:55:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来在你前面的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.00,0:55:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人不小心踢到了游戏板吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody must have kicked the board?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.63,0:55:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看没人「不小心踢到了」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, nobody kicked the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.17,0:55:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你作弊了！- 我没有！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You cheated. - No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.90,0:55:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你作弊！我就知道你会作弊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cheated. I knew you were gonna cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.87,0:55:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个词用得太过了！- 我没作弊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Cheater's" a strong word. - I didn't cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.14,0:56:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就是没作弊！- 安静 安静 孩子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't cheat! - Guys, guys. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.44,0:56:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小点声 大家都冷静些！好了 你动没动棋子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it down. Indoor voices. Now, did you move the piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.71,0:56:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是我不小心动了棋子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I moved the piece by an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.09,0:56:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 他不是故意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.05,0:56:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能会「不小心了移动棋子」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you move a piece by accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.82,0:56:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来那么牢固 不可能移动的 你作弊了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stuck to the game. It's impossible. You cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.33,0:56:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不别用那个词 不 不许说「作弊」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, let's not use that word. No, stop saying "cheated."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.46,0:56:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你作弊了！骗子！- 我没作弊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You cheated! Cheater! - I didn't cheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.33,0:56:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再吵了 好不好？你动之前棋子在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Okay? Now, where did you move from?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.50,0:56:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.64,0:56:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是呢！你刚才是在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you weren't. You were back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.84,0:56:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.08,0:56:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 小小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Here, careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.65,0:56:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上帝啊 - 好了 就是这儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God. - Okay, it's fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.08,0:56:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真不懂事！- 我才不是呢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're such a baby. - I'm not a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.08,0:56:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down. Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.49,0:56:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是！- 你就是！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not a baby. - You're a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.09,0:56:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有不懂事的小屁孩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody is a baby here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.52,0:56:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是小屁孩！- 你就是小屁孩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am not a baby! - You're a little baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.69,0:56:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是小屁孩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.86,0:56:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 有完没完！行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez, it won't stop! Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.76,0:56:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 赶紧继续游戏吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Let's play the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.83,0:57:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.31,0:57:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,转个不停！？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't stop spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.18,0:57:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 被你弄坏了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong with it? - You broke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.88,0:57:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 卡片出来了 看到没？它自己复原了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, there's the card. See? It fixed itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.92,0:57:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,「发现作弊者 自动弹射」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Caught cheating. Automatic ejection?"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.79,0:57:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说我吗？- 喔 你确实移了棋子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does it mean me? - Well, you did move the piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.66,0:57:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才是作弊的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one who cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.53,0:57:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.51,0:57:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住 沃尔特！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Walter!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.28,0:57:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来救你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.98,0:57:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.35,0:57:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！我有主意了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute! I got an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.19,0:58:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把这个灯扔给你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna swing this lamp up to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.53,0:58:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一抓住它 我就可以拉你下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you grab it, and I'll pull you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.03,0:58:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快我撑不住了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hang on any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.07,0:58:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急 我再找个灯去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I'll get another lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.91,0:58:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.83,0:58:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.24,0:58:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.32,0:58:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.37,0:59:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.90,0:59:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.48,0:59:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.45,0:59:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.18,0:59:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,到家之前都别跟我说话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk to me till we get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.45,0:59:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在底下看得津津有味吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That look cool from down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.29,0:59:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩可累得够呛… 那是相当的紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because up there it was… It was pretty intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.59,0:59:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我的心脏都快跳出来了 不过倒真挺有意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart's pumping pretty good. That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.33,0:59:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不快过去接着玩儿？快过去啊 离我远点儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you just play so I can get the heck out of here and get away from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.80,0:59:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说对不起了 - 随你便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told him I was sorry. - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.83,0:59:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 知道我们该做些什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what we need to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.74,0:59:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得消除彼此的成见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get our heads right, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.54,0:59:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,并齐心协力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull it together. As a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.21,0:59:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们三个！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.14,0:59:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了 哥儿们 努力点儿送我们回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up, big man. Bring us home.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.91,1:00:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事儿的 我罩着你 哥儿们 说到做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, buddy. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.04,1:00:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 写的什么？- 他不认字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's it say? - He can't read.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.68,1:00:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「丢失星系地图 退后两格 」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Lose map of galaxy. Go back two spaces."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.03,1:00:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 冻死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm freezing my ass off.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.06,1:00:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,40度？这俩小混蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty degrees? Those savages.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.55,1:01:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 9！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Nine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.38,1:01:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 转得好 - 转得好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good roll. - Good roll?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.25,1:01:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该说太棒了！- 我就是这个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nine's a great roll. - I meant great.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.99,1:01:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,金色的？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gold.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.05,1:01:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,「流星 经过时许一个愿望」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shooting star. Making a wish as it passes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.94,1:01:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这定是整个游戏里最棒的卡片啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gotta be the best card in the whole game.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.47,1:01:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快走完了 看 还有几步我就赢了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm almost to the end, look. A few more and I win.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.64,1:01:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望你赢 事实上 我不在乎谁赢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you win. I don't care who wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.44,1:01:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 反正你什么都赢不了 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because you never win at anything. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.81,1:01:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？正因为那样他才作弊 他从来都没赢过！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he cheats, he can never win.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.82,1:01:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能赢！- 喔 你当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I don't. - Yeah, you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.18,1:01:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才你差点害死我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you almost got me killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.92,1:01:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那不是我的错！- 不是你的错？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It wasn't my fault. - It's not your fault?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.75,1:01:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不是你的错？那全是你的错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it not your fault? This is all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.56,1:01:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是把事情搞砸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.23,1:01:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 爸妈才离婚的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your fault Mom and Dad got divorced.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.03,1:01:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！- 去你的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - You suck.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.10,1:02:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.37,1:02:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该许愿了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get my wish now, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.84,1:02:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.96,1:02:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.93,1:02:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do what?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.10,1:02:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别许这个愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wish what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.00,1:02:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不知道我在想什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.00,1:02:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 至少我敢肯定不是什么好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I can tell it ain't good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.11,1:02:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 人生气的时候 是不会有什么好主意的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. No matter how good an idea seems like when you're angry…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.85,1:02:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论那想法有多诱人 这事你得相信我 沃尔特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it never is. You gotta trust me on this one, Walter.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.63,1:03:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你许了什么愿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.23,1:03:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能告诉你 - 告诉我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't tell you. - Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.84,1:03:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道如果把愿望告诉别人 就…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the rules about wishing. If I told you, it won't…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.61,1:03:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你许了什么愿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you wished for.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.04,1:03:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.65,1:03:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.25,1:03:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.63,1:03:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿望实现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The card worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.83,1:03:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 实现了祝贺你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It worked, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.40,1:03:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们得接受 永远被困在宇宙中的事实了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're stuck in space now forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.14,1:03:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别和他吵！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.81,1:03:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你许的什么愿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.61,1:03:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个 - 你许愿要了个橄榄球？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This. - You wished for a football?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.45,1:04:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是布莱特·法佛尔（著名橄榄球星）签名的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signed by Brett Favre.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.92,1:04:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么许这个愿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you wish for a football?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.82,1:04:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以许愿让这游戏结束的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have just wished the game over.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.86,1:04:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以许愿让我们离开这里的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have wished us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.73,1:04:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时太紧张了 他冲我大喊大叫的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was under a lot of pressure. He was yelling at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.80,1:04:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛对他大喊大叫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were you yelling at him?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.21,1:04:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.68,1:04:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.08,1:04:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前玩过这个游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've played this game before.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.91,1:04:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？15年前我和我弟弟玩过这个游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I played it with my own brother 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.72,1:04:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也玩过？- 是的 和你们一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a player? - Yeah. Just like you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.82,1:04:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那时总闹不和{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were fighting a lot back then.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.36,1:04:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而开始那个游戏后 情况就变得更糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the game started, it got even worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.80,1:04:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,每过一回合 我俩就恨对方多一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time we spun, we got madder and madder at one another.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.73,1:04:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着 我得到了许愿的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I landed on the star space.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.40,1:04:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像刚才沃尔特那样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same one that Walter just landed on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.11,1:04:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 我太生他的气了 所以当流星经过时…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was so mad at him, that when the star passed…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.18,1:05:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我许下了心中的愿望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made my wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.11,1:05:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你许了什么愿望？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.58,1:05:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我许愿我希望我弟弟不要出生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wished that my brother had never been born.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.42,1:05:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我的上帝啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.15,1:05:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上我就后悔了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as I did it, I felt horrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.22,1:05:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为 如果我有机会再转到9…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought, you know, if I could spin again…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.59,1:05:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我能再次登陆到其它星球上… 把他带回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe I could land on another star space and… And wish him back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.70,1:05:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我没有办法…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the game wouldn't let me…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.83,1:05:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我的回合结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it wasn't my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.04,1:05:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.70,1:05:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些游戏…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are some games…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.84,1:05:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人玩儿是不够的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't play alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.58,1:05:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们现在该怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.38,1:05:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,下楼去 然后一气呵成把它玩完{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go back downstairs and we finish this thing once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.45,1:05:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许再作弊 不许再争吵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more cheating. No more arguing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.05,1:05:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要做的就是再拧几次钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you guys have to do is spin a few more times.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.22,1:05:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论发生什么事 我都会帮助你们度过难关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help you fight off whatever comes out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.62,1:05:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说定了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.46,1:05:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说定了 - 说定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Deal. - Deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.60,1:05:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是变热了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it getting hot in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.37,1:05:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把高炉下的标灯吹灭了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You blew out the pilot light on the furnace, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.74,1:06:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在这别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay put.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.80,1:06:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,涡刚人又来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zorgons.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.73,1:06:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的沙鼠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My gerbil was in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.00,1:06:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可糟糕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.34,1:06:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有大麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is very bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.61,1:06:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？我们没被它们吃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? We didn't get eaten.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.01,1:06:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把游戏放哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you leave the game?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.32,1:06:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,客厅啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the living room.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.05,1:06:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.82,1:06:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有游戏才能带我们回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game's our only way home,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.62,1:06:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在涡刚人把它弄去当燃料了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now the Zorgons are burning it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.12,1:06:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有一个办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one thing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.13,1:07:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还等人请你们啊？快来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for an invitation? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.61,1:07:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弄好的放到这里来 - 来啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put your back into it. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.72,1:07:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们要这么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.77,1:07:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.82,1:07:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要烧了房子啊？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys actually set the house on fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.49,1:07:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丽莎回来了！- 丽莎解冻了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lisa's back. - Lisa's unfrozen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.86,1:08:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事 太好了 丽莎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay. You're okay, Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.36,1:08:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我！放开我！赶紧去找灭火器！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me! Get off me! Try and find the fire extinguisher!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.86,1:08:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 丽莎 等等 不 丽莎 等等 - 不 丽莎 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Lisa, wait. No, Lisa, wait. - No, Lisa, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.83,1:08:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下！丽莎 别！- 火能把涡刚人招来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! Lisa, don't. - The Zorgons are attracted to fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.97,1:08:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽莎 别！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.50,1:08:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 丽莎！别这样！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Lisa, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.67,1:08:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 丽莎！我们得留着火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Lisa, don't do that. We gotta keep the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.97,1:08:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,火能招来涡刚人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Zorgons are attracted to fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.87,1:08:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽莎 等等 不 丽莎 别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa, wait. No, Lisa, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.98,1:08:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 丽莎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.12,1:08:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这下好了 - 现在我们再也拿不回游戏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great. - Now we'll never get the game back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.15,1:08:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别担心 它们回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Don't worry. They're back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.39,1:08:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？！- 帮忙的宇航员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell are you? - The astronaut.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.66,1:08:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你们玩的游戏里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the game we're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.86,1:08:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼招我来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny spun me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.34,1:08:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？！那是什么？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.14,1:08:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么了？！我们在哪儿？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.71,1:08:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们谁快说句话啊？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody please talk to me right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.55,1:09:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 它们在装备叉子 准备登陆我们这里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, they're arming the harpoons. They're gonna board us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.65,1:09:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么要登陆？！- 伙计们 机灵点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's gonna board us? - Guys, look alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.72,1:09:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么要登陆？！- 涡刚人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's gonna board us? - The Zorgons.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.82,1:09:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 涡刚人是什么？- 是蜥蜴人 它们吃肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's a Zorgon? - They're lizard-men. They eat meat.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.13,1:09:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们是肉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're meat!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.54,1:09:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们快躲到楼下！- 好 听着 他们过来以后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Iet's hide downstairs! - Okay, listen, when they dock…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.61,1:09:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会潜入飞船 把游戏拿回来 明白了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll sneak on the ship and steal the game. You got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.31,1:09:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.64,1:09:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她刚才说楼下？- 噢 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did she say downstairs? - Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.99,1:09:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.39,1:09:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们呆一块儿 一切都会没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay with us, and everything will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.10,1:09:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never leave you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.01,1:09:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move, move.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.65,1:10:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.42,1:10:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 外面情况危急{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. It's gotten pretty serious out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.89,1:10:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得躲在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you guys to hide in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.96,1:10:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这个和我保持联络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep in touch with these.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.96,1:10:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没法用 被丹尼弄坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't work. Danny broke them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.70,1:10:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天线被揪下来了 彻底没救了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He pulled off the antenna. They're completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.63,1:10:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,试音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Testing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.04,1:10:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,管用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It works.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.10,1:11:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 调低音量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, keep the volume low.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.01,1:11:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量在逼不得以时再用它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only use that if you need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.71,1:11:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等… 等等 你去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wa… Wait, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.51,1:11:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找回游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go find the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.22,1:11:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的眼睛好漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has gorgeous eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.43,1:11:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.70,1:11:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 他想保护我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He obviously feels very protective over me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.67,1:11:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.64,1:11:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得在他身边很有安全感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just feel so safe around him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.14,1:11:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,涡刚人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zorgons.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.84,1:11:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.48,1:11:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是 它们包围了整个地下室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place is crawling with them. They're all over the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.31,1:11:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我好像在角落里看到游戏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I think in the corner I see the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.18,1:11:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 盒子就在那里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the box is right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.22,1:11:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,先这样 我… 我得再靠近点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, I'm… I'm gonna get closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.09,1:11:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿到游戏了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he get the game?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.83,1:12:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？- 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.54,1:12:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吗？喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you there? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.24,1:12:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening? - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.51,1:12:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.38,1:12:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏就放在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game was right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.61,1:12:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在壁炉对面 可我没法拿到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was right across from the furnace. I couldn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.08,1:12:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多涡刚人了 充满了整个地下室！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many of them down there. They're all over the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.82,1:12:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上有吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.82,1:13:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还没 可一旦它们收拾完楼下…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet. But as soon as they're done down there…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.53,1:13:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 你已经尽力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. You tried your hardest.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.06,1:13:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们相信你 - 省省吧你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We believe in you. - Will you please?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.07,1:13:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.77,1:13:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以用那小升降机 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The dumbwaiter. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.94,1:13:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小升降机就停在壁炉对面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dumbwaiter is across from the furnace.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.67,1:13:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个小升降梯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little elevator.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.88,1:13:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以从那里潜入…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could sneak right in it…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.04,1:13:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先把你放下去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll lower you down…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.25,1:13:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着你拿上游戏…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could grab the game…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.95,1:13:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们再把你拉上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll pull you right back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.62,1:13:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.32,1:13:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 沃尔特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Walter?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.15,1:13:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 不过他体积似乎太大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but he's too big.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.02,1:13:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.03,1:13:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 这还算是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a good plan, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.23,1:13:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a great plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.76,1:13:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.23,1:13:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.77,1:13:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进不去 真太糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad he wouldn't fit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.10,1:13:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我都进不去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't even fit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.74,1:13:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实只要有个个子足够小的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure wish we knew someone that was small enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.98,1:13:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真那么需要那游戏吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we really need the game?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.46,1:14:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.53,1:14:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.13,1:14:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 别紧张 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. It's gonna be real easy, okay?
