Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.22,1:35:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我赢了！我赢了Zathura！- 我们到家了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I won the game. I beat Zathura. - We're home.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.76,1:35:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们回家了！- 成功了！我们回家了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're home! - We did it. We're home.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.73,1:35:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好象地记得告诉你们别玩过火了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I distinctly remember asking you guys not to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.70,1:35:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 太棒了 有个游戏…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, it was so awesome. There was this game…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.27,1:35:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它把我们送到了外太空 - 还有个黑洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and it sent us to outer space. - And there was a black hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.14,1:35:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差点被永远困在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We almost had to stay forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.81,1:35:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从涡刚人那里偷回游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole the game from the Zorgons.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.55,1:35:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我看到未来的自己了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I saw myself older.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.11,1:35:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很有意思啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.11,1:35:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快3点了 妈妈随时会到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost 3:00, and Mom's gonna be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.75,1:35:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上所有的书 游戏 任何你们想带到她那里的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab all games and books, whatever you wanna take to her house.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.75,1:35:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 准备走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.92,1:35:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔得好！正中胸前 接这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good throw. Right to the chest. Catch this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.56,1:35:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接住啦！- 漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Caught it. - Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.40,1:35:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了？要投了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, ready? Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.73,1:35:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱特·法佛尔准备向后投球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brett Favre takes the snap.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.72,1:36:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在寻找队友 传得好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's looking. It's a great pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.90,1:36:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 触地得分 - 触地得分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Touchdown. - Touchdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.01,1:36:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 就好！- 嘿 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just a second, Mom. - Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.35,1:36:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱特·法佛尔签名的那个橄榄球哪去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the football signed by Brett Favre?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.18,1:36:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不见了 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's gone. - What happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.42,1:36:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没发生过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.22,1:36:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.99,1:36:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远都不再提这事 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never speak of this. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.23,1:36:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没发生过！- 没发生过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Never happened. - Never happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.57,1:36:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还觉得我的眼睛漂亮么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still think I have gorgeous eyes?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.97,1:36:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 沃尔特 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Walter. - What?
